{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "130b09491f96ae8b2f8cdf7bf6594785b4103a25c71cb6c3a415caab27080aa9", "ja": "（今日は宣材写真撮影だが、当の紬が\nなかなか楽屋から出てこない……呼んでくるか）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄宣传照，但是身为主角的䌷\n却迟迟不从休息室出来……我去叫她好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "468fd07523465779a0e97222ac188d3d927aa70500bffcf63b9d3f92ded58684", "ja": "…………。\n…………にこっ。", "zh": "…………\n…………（微笑）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5a93ae2bf6926b2ac76268d7cb60b0d0e80b49e2de5b293a225f94c0aa8afcab", "ja": "なんだ紬、笑顔の練習してたのか。\n気合いが入ってるな！", "zh": "怎么？䌷，你在练习笑容吗？\n很认真嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ea1aab6d8dbb28d6f15178089d838f10bfa55dd4cc5976029948cfe2434528b6", "ja": "！？　……{$P$}？\n黙って人を盗み見ているなんて……。", "zh": "啊！？{$P$}？\n你居然偷窥我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4c7757b11523d959f170c34befcf575f3eb070038b939571ff25fdca92d4584d", "ja": "最近わかって来たのですが、\nあなたはきっと、とても不躾な方なのですね？", "zh": "最近我开始感受到了，\n你肯定是非常没教养的人，对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d5d8bbca03d6d29a2ee4988f30b795f9d1e25df66b33d44be7e5c3658e292a18", "ja": "いや、盗み見てたわけじゃないぞ？\n入ってきたら、ちょうど紬がいただけだ。", "zh": "你误会了，我可没有偷窥哦。\n只是我进门的时候，䌷也刚好在里面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9afe016d81c666e758bd19c95bcfdb3259285c3c8eff5de07aba4878ece2d896", "ja": "そんなことより、撮影が始まるのですよね。\n急いで参りましょうか。", "zh": "那不重要了，拍摄要开始了对吧？\n我们赶快过去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1008_camman", "source_sha256": "a88138ad7f3e26a0a289d848012843aa17a777aff57dedc2e23c1c9a5f3df8eb", "ja": "うーん、ちょっと笑顔が硬いですね。\n緊張してますか？", "zh": "嗯──你的笑容有点僵硬呢。\n太紧张了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0c0c18043904c5c61119745be50dff4ac83ed06f4f6da297e9ccac9547535eb5", "ja": "えっ？　硬い、ですか……。\n……練習、したんやけど……。", "zh": "咦？僵硬，是吗……\n……但人家练习很久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1010_camman", "source_sha256": "71833e80d5e62e56ee71ce0d5f3133266bd50a8f3f6bab72a897604614769aaa", "ja": "緊張しなくても大丈夫ですよ！\nリラックスしてください♪", "zh": "不用那么紧张没关系！\n请放松吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7ce501cf3cf92d1ad7e9542f3c412ce599aa8a5cdb8d7424e8a54f0e9fcd7874", "ja": "はぁ、リラックス……そう、言われましても……。\nうう……。", "zh": "好的，要放松……说是这么说，可是……\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8c0187e353cb55668994cf5a0aeb5e402e2b9c409c5e2615fdc505b2e3f46256", "ja": "（ちょっと気合いが入り過ぎてるみたいだな。\nここはひとつ、肩の力を抜かせるために……）", "zh": "（她好像太过紧绷了。\n现在要先设法帮助她放松……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "da935951d17dcf417fa91f1d0cebbe552260d24a3f775d37a81db6f48e346777", "ja": "紬、いい調子だから、深く考えずに続けてみよう。\n何度も試していれば、そのうち慣れる！", "zh": "䌷，你现在状况不错，别想太多，先继续试试吧。\n多尝试几次，总是会习惯的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e3e585b609f3e4615f13b567fe763353fa05cdf4ff4f94c01d0360c0e0673361", "ja": "たった今、笑顔が硬いと言われたばかりですのに。\nどこがどういう具合にいい調子だとお思いですか？", "zh": "刚刚摄影师才说我笑容太僵硬，\n请问你是从哪里看出来我状况不错呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d5a9afae752475979ae07c1a2eefb5d5781a7ec348c216612f66617b8fde9158", "ja": "そ、そうだな。どこがと言われると困るけど、\n強いて言うなら……。", "zh": "这、这个嘛，我也无法明确说出是哪里，\n硬要说的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_1017", "source_sha256": "2533ad11cfeec31aff7c40e1e128f2b9f1b6cedcb64e78bc6945c7d6ddd27d58", "ja": "前向きな姿勢", "zh": "积极的态度", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5bf5586b5250f31dc2260daaf0097207a02e0c0c206a1cd9f79a6afa6b13a79e", "ja": "アイドルへの、前向きな姿勢かな。\n一生懸命、いい写真を撮ってもらおうとしてるから。", "zh": "因为你对偶像的态度非常积极吧。\n可以看出你拚命地想拍出好照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "34a2b67b0c7856555babd2c646123c347e39fc88d8715f0d0b75901d8f0a72d9", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そんなん……\n当たり前やし……。", "zh": "什么？但、但那不是……\n理所当然的吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2002_se", "source_sha256": "a393f153beba9193b68690ab68995c288177bc7f37c7bc43dd123a77901ceb5e", "ja": "カシャカシャカシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1402dd1d572a2e05f37eae6b961933529a0ea5293839e378123de54066301035", "ja": "っ……！\nあ、あの？　これは一体……？", "zh": "唔……！\n不、不好意思？请问这是怎么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2004_camman", "source_sha256": "a940ac55d63736310c61287412d6ae98aff9c01a7d463e410743e90b2d937eab", "ja": "あ、すみません！　でも、すごく生き生きとした\n表情だったので。あっ、その表情も素敵ですね！", "zh": "啊，不好意思！因为你的表情实在太生动了。\n啊，这个表情也很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c4a2965639ce43d7b54bb5340c4cf4353cdb84b8a1c54acc2ae2b78e02b01f67", "ja": "けど、私はただ、驚いただけで……。\n写真に撮ってもらうようなものでは……。", "zh": "可是，我只是感到惊讶罢了……\n这种表情不适合拍成照片吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2006_camman", "source_sha256": "488fda39203616e6d5fb033fce3a6f0211ba5f6ee6170c4d02d64a777d9f16cf", "ja": "あっ、その顔もいいですね！\nいただきます♪", "zh": "啊，现在这个表情也很棒哦！\n我拍下来啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2007_se", "source_sha256": "a393f153beba9193b68690ab68995c288177bc7f37c7bc43dd123a77901ceb5e", "ja": "カシャカシャカシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "79a10c782ae75d3fdc33bd2585ca5faf2eb56bbc04557243d616151a9bf99109", "ja": "ま、また……。\n変な顔ばっかり……。", "zh": "又、又来了……\n一直拍这些奇怪的表情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2009_p", "source_sha256": "41fc8ea4ad00c677d5eb55545c2487150f603413ad77d7a2170fb1f0ae7c7732", "ja": "いいぞ紬、いい表情だ。その調子！", "zh": "很好哦，䌷，你的表情很棒。保持下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "588214ca3d496ded3b4696d0a6e4e59793075a1c815701c14a8fcbbfdf7a2a3a", "ja": "そ、そんな、あてがいなこと……。\nもう～っ！", "zh": "你、你也讲得，太随便了吧……\n真是的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2011_p", "source_sha256": "34c1f879bd1c576335b2205fa5a075b10f7b05568b546cd664d4544b9e0d534a", "ja": "お疲れさま、紬！\n今の写真、現像してもらってきたぞ。", "zh": "辛苦了，䌷！\n刚才拍的照片已经洗出来啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dc2221442b57043037cbccc70bba0be2bfeff4ec9ff02940ceb1c30241dcbe10", "ja": "どうせ、おかしな顔をしているのでしょう？\n半分……いえ、8割方あなたのせいです。", "zh": "反正一定都是些奇怪的表情吧？\n有一半……不，有八成都是你的错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2013_p", "source_sha256": "1bf9abe89584f6c082cfe3699e89fbba8b396b24820d2f32dc543fb4c3e4baad", "ja": "おかしな顔をしているかどうか、\n自分の目で確かめてみてほしいな。ほら。", "zh": "你亲眼确认看看\n自己的表情到底奇不奇怪吧。拿去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b824fd5c88ced69d95107694d7648d127ee16f0cdde8de6c5e1f437adf4d87c9", "ja": "！　これが……、私？\nこんなに、いろんな顔をして……。", "zh": "啊！这是……我吗？\n表情居然这么多变化……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "442e5e7a3d4ec32080e6ca37436df6f8ed843a3888c9654540abbd0b5bb48c8c", "ja": "自分の顔なのに、初めて見たような気がします。\nそうなん……。うち、こんな顔で……。", "zh": "明明都是自己的脸，却有种很陌生的感觉。\n原来……人家刚才是这样的表情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4d7bc6de5262b9a7c869a56b781a534474167bf664200748112509508f12c552", "ja": "これが……アイドルの、私……。", "zh": "这就是……成为偶像的，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2017_p", "source_sha256": "2dbd01f4aa2e62f6254108a1027290a0eeaf66d7146ce215a3dd74d3286a7346", "ja": "どれも、すごくいい写真だと思う。\nだからこの際、全部使うつもりだ。", "zh": "我觉得每一张照片都很棒。\n既然如此，干脆全都采用吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2018_p", "source_sha256": "78485dc139732d4c7123900dcaedc2415cc058f69760e0cbaf71b390be625e00", "ja": "クライアントによって使い分けるとか、まとめて\n1ページに載せるとか。見せ方はいろいろあるしな。", "zh": "可以按照不同客户分别使用，\n也能全都放在同一页上。展现的方式多得很呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d6697633e6e7d410cb6bcea9dabf89523ffba25e58d58f49b7c12fcc22198c47", "ja": "そうですか。よろしくお願いします。\n今日はその、色々と大変でしたけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？那就麻烦你了。\n今天遇到了许多困难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "07c61c09b26777aeb357da95a5e3772e475d26ca58ae23c84019ec445caabf8e", "ja": "私がこれだけ恥ずかしい思いをしたのですから、\nそれに見合うお仕事を、取ってきてくださいね。", "zh": "既然我都经历了这么羞耻的事情，\n请你一定要替我接到适合的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2021_p", "source_sha256": "3bc4e8997e3d4426fdc64405a2d1d85949ee783f5dd0dca2ab4c229824d92c9d", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ。\n約束するよ！", "zh": "好，那是当然。\n一言为定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_002_2022_p", "source_sha256": "2efb0adf452caff937f87572be6bd65e74b09b93fa748a1ae5f58f49e0e8f897", "ja": "（いい宣材写真が撮れたことで、紬はますます\nやる気になったみたいだ。今後が楽しみだな……！）", "zh": "（因为拍出不错的宣传照，\n䌷似乎也更加有干劲了。真期待她以后的发展……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
